# Phase-5 invariant fixture for inc-jcg4.  The standard orc has innate
# infravision, acquires and equips no light, and casts Deeper Darkness around
# himself so normal-light vision contributes no detected cells.  Every cell
# detected inside the globe therefore comes from the orc's non-normal sense.

@include chargen-rogue.keys
ESC

# Wizard learning marks the spell innate, so the level-one rogue can cast it
# deterministically without depending on mana, class, god or the fixed seed.
w y
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Deeper Darkness" ENTER
m
@choose "Deeper Darkness"
RIGHT ENTER

# Save the already-dark character.  The invariant run restores this save in a
# fresh process with the map probe enabled, so chargen and pre-cast normal
# vision never enter the byte comparison.
ESC a
